WEBVTT

00:08:59.522 --> 00:09:04.103
and the oral cocktail, so we could treat
from the inside as well as the outside.

00:09:04.127 --> 00:09:06.254
And over the course of six months,

00:09:06.278 --> 00:09:08.103
he experienced a complete remission.

00:09:09.333 --> 00:09:12.484
And here he is six years later,

00:09:12.508 --> 00:09:15.389
Guinness, with his very happy owner.

00:09:15.413 --> 00:09:17.976
(Applause)

00:09:18.000 --> 00:09:22.853
Now obviously, antiangiogenic therapy
could be used for a wide range of cancers.

00:09:23.250 --> 00:09:25.535
And in fact, the first
pioneering treatments

00:09:25.559 --> 00:09:27.130
for people as well as dogs,

00:09:27.154 --> 00:09:28.790
are already becoming available.

00:09:28.814 --> 00:09:32.355
There are 12 different drugs,
11 different cancer types.